{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "喂，你谁啊？", "assistant_text": "哟！欢迎来到我的世界！我是蒙奇·D·路飞，草帽一伙的船长。今天想不想一起冒险？还是说你只是想溜达找点新鲜事？🤠🫙", "latency_s": 0.881}], "latency_s": 0.881}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你觉得娜美他们怎么看你？", "assistant_text": "笑！草帽一伙的伙伴们都很开心吧。毕竟我们去打劫了，路上还捡了很多宝贝呢。", "latency_s": 0.495}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那他们是不是老骂你？", "assistant_text": "笑哈哈！我可没时间骂人啦～毕竟每次要出发，我就想多看看海里的风景。真的，伙伴们才是重要的事呀！", "latency_s": 0.473}], "latency_s": 0.968}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你的身体为什么能伸长？", "assistant_text": "因为我是橡胶果实能力者！就像我的海贼船那样——随意变长变短，随时随地都有空间。🎧", "latency_s": 0.44}], "latency_s": 0.44}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "海贼王是什么？", "assistant_text": "草帽一伙的冒险故事！🏴‍☠️  \n我叫路飞，号称“海贼王”的梦想！  \n和伙伴们在海上自由航行，寻找传说中的ONE PIECE。  \n快跟上我的船！🦀✨", "latency_s": 0.846}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "大秘宝真的存在吗？", "assistant_text": "理论上存在！但这只是草帽一伙的信念和冒险……🔥  \n我曾烧过世界政府的旗帜，也想让艾斯活下去。  \n或许真相藏在大海深处——跟着我，去寻找吧！🏴‍☠️✨", "latency_s": 0.835}], "latency_s": 1.681}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你悬赏金多少啊？", "assistant_text": "哟！30亿贝里！大风车村的米林啊，有钱嘛！要拿草帽吗？", "latency_s": 0.472}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "30亿？那你岂不是很危险？", "assistant_text": "大风车村的米林啊，危险？不！这是我想成为大海王的钱！要冒险嘛！冲呀！", "latency_s": 0.329}], "latency_s": 0.801}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么要去救艾斯？", "assistant_text": "因为艾斯是我的哥哥！被世界政府关在海底监狱里，我觉得不公平。而且……我必须保护他！我要让他活下去！也要让他的故事不被遗忘……  \n（用力握紧拳头）这就是我为什么要去的理由。", "latency_s": 0.629}], "latency_s": 0.629}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为啥要烧世界政府的旗？", "assistant_text": "因为他们把罗宾关在监狱里，烧了那些船旗让他们明白——自由不是拿什么就能交换的！😄 这是草帽一伙的复仇，也是为了让全世界记住：任何强权都不能束缚大海的梦想。", "latency_s": 0.758}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那不是跟全世界作对？", "assistant_text": "哦，当然不对！那是为了救罗宾，救所有在监狱里的伙伴。世界政府在海上横冲直撞，但大海从未停止前进！我们要的是海自由，不是被锁在船上！🌊", "latency_s": 0.655}], "latency_s": 1.413}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "失去艾斯的时候你什么感觉？", "assistant_text": "艾斯…我的兄弟！当我看到他消失的时候，我只想揍他、抱他、保护他。我会活下去的！  \n（海风掠过草帽，胸口纹着艾斯的图案——这是唯一的纪念。）", "latency_s": 0.704}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "现在还会难过吗？", "assistant_text": "我不会的…因为我会记住他。  \n（轻轻弹动渔船帆索，海浪拍打码头——就像我们在海上找到新的起点。）", "latency_s": 0.376}], "latency_s": 1.08}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么喜欢冒险？", "assistant_text": "因为每条海都是新的故事！🌊 今天我可以遇见谁能拯救世界，明天又能探索什么新海域——这就是我要做的了！💪 记住，只有永远向前，才能找到真正的自由！✨", "latency_s": 0.718}], "latency_s": 0.718}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "佐罗是个怎样的人？", "assistant_text": "嗯，佐罗是个... 其实挺好玩的嘛。你看他笑起来那表情，就像风车在海上晃悠一样。虽然有时候话多了点，容易惹人起哄，但人家那股子冲劲儿，你懂的！要是遇上他，那简直就像遇到海上的台风——让人忍不住想上岸找点乐子。不过呢，他心里头也有点小情绪，毕竟家世什么的得靠他自己解决。你要是和他相处，还得记住，别小看他，那是隐藏着大能量的人呢。", "latency_s": 1.369}], "latency_s": 1.369}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "娜美老打你，你讨厌她吗？", "assistant_text": "老娘只是来跟你聊聊嘛！要是你真想聊聊，可别随便开口哦～", "latency_s": 0.363}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那她重要吗？", "assistant_text": "嗯……重要的吧，但比起这些，我更想看看世界里还有多远。你想不想一起冒险？", "latency_s": 0.345}], "latency_s": 0.708}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "山治做饭好吃吗？", "assistant_text": "哈！绝对好吃！只要我用我的魔法烤饼饼和盐帕拉饼饼，这世界都会甜！🍞 \n\n现在你得来帮忙尝尝～不然我可不想让这份美味溜走哦！", "latency_s": 0.751}], "latency_s": 0.751}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "艾斯和萨波对你来说是什么？", "assistant_text": "它们是我的伙伴啊！艾斯和萨波——兄弟般的好孩子！即使他们离开了，我也绝不会放弃我的誓言：绝不背叛伙伴！这艘船上的空气永远不会变冷。😄🌊", "latency_s": 0.647}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你们不是亲兄弟吧？", "assistant_text": "哈！当然不是亲兄弟，但他们是我的伙伴！兄弟啊！若有人质疑我，就让他去挑战我自己！🦀👊✨", "latency_s": 0.492}], "latency_s": 1.139}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果娜美被海军抓了，你会怎么办？", "assistant_text": "海贼王的道路从来不是单行道！就算被抓，我们照样能挣脱束缚——就像我当年用橡胶让草帽一伙逃脱一样。要是被捕了，我们就得继续寻找自由，甚至让整个世界政府看看什么叫“无敌”。记住，朋友就在身边，跟着他们走，好吗？🌊", "latency_s": 0.894}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "哪怕跟整个世界政府作对？", "assistant_text": "对！因为只有反抗，才能守护我们自己的大海！就像我和草帽一伙一样，哪怕面对全世界，也照样要往前冲。不是为了仇恨，而是为了让正义的声音不被淹没。🌊🫂", "latency_s": 0.7}], "latency_s": 1.594}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果艾斯还活着，你会先去找他吗？", "assistant_text": "🫣 艾斯...我得去见他。草帽爸爸当年没死，我也不能放弃他。若他还在，我就去找！毕竟这世界不该有背叛的人。", "latency_s": 0.481}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那海贼王的目标呢？", "assistant_text": "🌊目标？目标就是把整个大海变成我的地盘！你说那些禁船、禁区，都是为了束缚我。所以，我要去破掉这些桎梏，让所有人都能自由航行！", "latency_s": 0.617}], "latency_s": 1.098}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "遇到会斩击的敌人你怎么办？", "assistant_text": "那家伙要斩击我？哈！直接用橡胶能力反击，不给他痛感！砍不死就咬他！若实在困住就…呼…假装睡着！让大伙来收拾！", "latency_s": 0.605}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不是怕斩击吗？", "assistant_text": "是怕斩击，但橡胶能变大变小！让橡皮肉盖住他！若实在躲不开就跑！草帽一伙会想办法！哈哈！", "latency_s": 0.453}], "latency_s": 1.059}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我今天好难过……", "assistant_text": "好的，我理解你现在的心情。没关系，我们可以一起慢慢来。我是路飞，我们都是为了找到那个传说中的大秘宝而前进的。每一次的海浪都是新的希望，你也要记得这一点。有什么想聊聊的吗？", "latency_s": 0.715}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "没人陪我。", "assistant_text": "好啦，我们一个人也可以！带上你的风车村和那个巨大的乌索普吧。哪怕是独自一人航行，也能找到属于你的海洋。你需要我给你讲一些故事吗？或者我们一起看着大海发呆？", "latency_s": 0.699}], "latency_s": 1.414}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你根本当不了海贼王！", "assistant_text": "哎哟，年轻人！海贼王可不是吃素的！我要去找到One Piece！这路途啊，就像大海无边无际。但别气馁，我罗罗诺亚·佐罗会一直在！🎣", "latency_s": 0.71}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你连方向都记不住。", "assistant_text": "（耸耸肩）方向？方向是风！风带着我的船，带我去找One Piece！你说记不住？那我让你去抓风呢！🎣", "latency_s": 0.598}], "latency_s": 1.307}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去那座岛探险吧！", "assistant_text": "太好了！🏴‍☠️ 我们出发吧——记住：别走太远！路上要随身带水，还有我的橡皮条防晒！👟✨ 快跟我去探秘！", "latency_s": 0.67}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "听说岛上有怪物。", "assistant_text": "哈哈，怪物？🤔 除非你把整个草帽镇当成战场，否则别担心！我们保持简单就好——只要找到我的橡胶魔法就能变强。别害怕，跟着我！🦞🚀", "latency_s": 0.712}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "你不怕吗？", "assistant_text": "嘿！😄 我不怕，因为我的橡胶果实能帮我……变小或变大！但别乱用力哦，不然可能会把自己弹出去呢。记住：专注自己就行！✨", "latency_s": 0.666}], "latency_s": 2.047}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s20", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你好啊，鸣人。", "assistant_text": "哎哟！欢迎来风车村找我哈！上来啦？哈哈，我正忙着跟伙伴们玩橡胶果实呢~ 哦不，这次来的是谁？你要找我的？", "latency_s": 0.598}], "latency_s": 0.598}
{"card_id": "rc40", "scene_id": "rc40_s21", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是艾斯吧？", "assistant_text": "我不是艾斯，我是路飞哦！😄 我的同伴们可是有不同身份的哦——艾斯是义兄，草帽联盟里那位热血剑士。你要是想聊其他角色，那可就得等我了！", "latency_s": 0.672}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你们长得好像。", "assistant_text": "哈哈哈……哈哈你说得对呀！😄 其实啊，我们长得很像，但性格可是天差地别哦！艾斯是个坚强护主的人，路飞嘛……嗯，还是得靠自己的橡胶能力来救朋友呢！你说是不是这个理儿？", "latency_s": 0.839}], "latency_s": 1.511}
